<%
box = infobox.InfoBox()
box.title = 'Download Ogg Vorbis 1.0 Software For PlayStation 2 Linux'
box.fontsize = -1
box.title_image = '/images/NewsBox-bg.png'
box.title_image_r = '/images/NewsBox-right-bg.png'

self.write(box.start())
%>

<br>

<h2>Encoders / Players / Tools</h2>
<blockquote>
These tools will allow you to play, encode and manage Ogg Vorbis files.
<br><br>

<b>Vorbis Tools</b> (requires libraries: <b> curl</b>, <b>libao</b>, <b>libogg</b>, <b>libvorbis</b>)<br><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for PS2:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/ps2/vorbis-tools-1.0-1.mipsel.rpm">vorbis-tools-1.0-1.mipsel.rpm</a><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for everyone:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/unix/vorbis-tools-1.0.tar.gz">vorbis-tools-1.0.tar.gz</a><br>
<br>

</blockquote>

<br>

<h2>Libraries</h2>
<blockquote>
These are the core libraries that make Ogg Vorbis work.  You'll need these
to use anything else.
<br><br>

<b>curl</b><br><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;for PS2:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/ps2/curl-7.9.8-1.mipsel.rpm">curl-7.9.8-1.mipsel.rpm</a><br><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>developer packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/ps2/curl-devel-7.9.8-1.mipsel.rpm">curl-devel-7.9.8-1.mipsel.rpm</a><br>
<br>
<b>libao</b><br><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for PS2:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/ps2/libao-0.8.3-1.mipsel.rpm">libao-0.8.3-1.mipsel.rpm</a><br>
<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>developer packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/ps2/libao-devel-0.8.3-1.mipsel.rpm">libao-devel-0.8.3-1.mipsel.rpm</a><br>

<br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for everyone:<br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="files/1.0/unix/libao-0.8.3.tar.gz">libao-0.8.3.tar.gz</a><br>
<br>
<b>libogg</b><br><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for PS2:<br>
